==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~33.33 seconds<sup>300f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~40 seconds<sup>500f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~53.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Zir Zeal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Miss Haka]] spawns as the boss after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 70% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 30% HP:
**1 [[Zory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is easy to rush with some Starting Money UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and one other [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rusher]] to clear a path for him, since the Zombies will burrow immediately after spawning and the base only has 300k HP.

Otherwise it is essentially a DPS check to kill Lord Gravey before Miss Haka makes her way to the Cat Base.

Just spam High-DPS Units like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to kill Lord Gravey, while using cats like [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight Cat]] to knock Miss Haka back repeatedly, basically stalling her for however long you can. If you can, kill Lord Gravey using the [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] to prevent him from reviving.

