==Trivia==
*A 1LDK is a term for a simple apartment that consists solely of the 3 most important rooms: the living room, dining room and kitchen, thus creating the acronym L-D-K.
*Since it's in [[Mouseyland]], The Haunted 1LDK may be a reference to [[wikipedia:The Haunted Mansion|The Haunted Mansion]] at Disneyland.
*This is the only stage in Stories of Legend to feature an event enemy.

